{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n在最新一集TVB節目《跟風旅行團》中，杜如風（Helen）徹底化身瘋狂粉絲！一聽到偶像G-Dragon（GD）同款香氛，她即時失控狂奔入店，更興奮得當場「GD上身」大跳《Bang Bang Bang》，期間她更金句連連，場面極度爆笑，究竟這位「旅遊達人」的追星行為有多瘋狂？\n</p>\n<h2>一聞GD味即失控 杜如風化身「G-Helen」店內狂舞</h2>\n<p>今集節目以「24 小時瘋狂快閃」為主題，當中最爆趣的畫面，莫過於杜如風一聽到「GD 同款香氛」即雙眼發光，拔足狂奔衝向店舖。一踏入店內，她已忍不住興奮大叫：「GD，GD……GD 都會用嘅沐浴露，我都用緊。」她更對偶像喜好了如指掌，專業地介紹：「佢用嘅味道係 Hotel Wood，因為佢好鍾意住酒店，佢就將酒店味道帶返屋企。」在試搽 Hotel Wood Body Wash Lotion 時，Helen 更是戲癮大發，忍不住GD上身，即場化身「G-Helen」大跳《Bang Bang Bang》，瘋狂舉動完全展現其粉絲心態！</p>\n<h2>視GD為偶像曾扮對方造型 杜如風獲本尊偷拍Post上網</h2>\n<p>杜如風對GD的迷戀早有前科，她向來視GD為超級偶像，今次到韓國拍攝更專誠打扮成GD的招牌造型，親身到對方住所附近「朝聖」。最意想不到的是，她的舉動竟然被GD本人從遠處偷拍，並將照片發佈到社交平台上，這份「粉絲福利」讓杜如風當場開心到癲，難怪她今次一見到與偶像相關的產品就如此失控，可見其追星之路早已達到「巔峰成就」。</p>\n<h2>杜如風「沐浴巨星」金句連環爆發 爛Gag笑翻全場</h2>\n<p>除了化身「G-Helen」跳舞，杜如風在店內亦大放連串「杜式爛gag」，娛樂性十足。當她拿起香氛沐浴露時，她便抵死地說：「今次真係沐浴巨星」，更笑言：「我喺屋企練咗好耐」。當店員為她服務時，她又發揮幽默本色說：「你唔好嚟 Flirt 我，直接溝我啦」，連串金句令現場工作人員捧腹大笑，盡顯其獨一無二的搞笑魅力。</p>\n<h2>網民洗版大讚可愛：「追星嘅我本人！」</h2>\n<p>節目播出後，杜如風的瘋狂追星行為引來網民熱烈討論，不少觀眾都大讚她表現真實又可愛。網民紛紛留言洗版：「Helen真係好癲好可愛，完全係追星嘅我本人！」、「睇佢跳Bang Bang Bang笑到我肚痛！」、「G-Helen呢個名好正，求下佢出道！」、「最估唔到係佢真係俾GD影過，人生勝利組！」、「杜式爛gag永遠都唔會令人失望！」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_3370300576af92088b3ddf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_3370300576af92088b3ddf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_2856017196af9209c954da.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_2856017196af9209c954da.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_12946790646af920b2262d0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_12946790646af920b2262d0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_9676483516af920c006870.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_9676483516af920c006870.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/26_3606419246af9212110c01.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/26_3606419246af9212110c01.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/27_1877688426af9212a58cb9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/27_1877688426af9212a58cb9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_5621405516af92092cdc46.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_5621405516af92092cdc46.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_11169147006af920abe9b06.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_11169147006af920abe9b06.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_6147489906af920b9128c0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_6147489906af920b9128c0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_7169615606af920c591875.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_7169615606af920c591875.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_8565615396af920d048b98.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_8565615396af920d048b98.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_20687495736af920d89dd34.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_20687495736af920d89dd34.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_18852923876af9205e12473.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_18852923876af9205e12473.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_7372956716af92066c12b7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_7372956716af92066c12b7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_18325780406af9206c14ac6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_18325780406af9206c14ac6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05_666839086af92072701ae.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05_666839086af92072701ae.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06_16291191706af92078d93a5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06_16291191706af92078d93a5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_6154041316af9207fedf6f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_6154041316af9207fedf6f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T01:30:04.213752+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1396,"images":18,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T01:00:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T01:23:37.812124+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T01:23:37.812124+00:00","content_hash":"55b4b76710e02c9eeee6fc22db915df595ce8902c7913407cbf8811330afbc4f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}